WEBVTT

01:04.680 --> 01:06.440
How about this?

01:07.280 --> 01:08.440
Drink.

01:10.200 --> 01:11.960
General, Empress Dowager wants to see you.

01:13.600 --> 01:15.039
Let her in.

01:15.039 --> 01:15.920
Yes.

01:26.200 --> 01:28.440
I seem to have disturbed you.

01:36.240 --> 01:37.800
I've long heard that you're brave.

01:38.759 --> 01:39.960
I saw it with my own eyes.

01:41.320 --> 01:43.759
General, that's nothing.

02:24.240 --> 02:26.160
I'm waiting for you.

02:27.600 --> 02:29.000
Show me.

02:29.600 --> 02:31.000
Your trump card

02:31.600 --> 02:33.680
is not for you to fall in love.

02:36.560 --> 02:37.360
What?

02:39.440 --> 02:40.640
You don't like it?

02:47.120 --> 02:48.880
Your tricks

02:50.440 --> 02:52.000
I'm exactly what I want.

02:54.120 --> 02:55.840
Be careful, General.

02:57.240 --> 02:59.600
Falling in love with someone who doesn't like you

03:01.960 --> 03:03.240
is dangerous.

03:22.440 --> 03:23.920
You worry too much.

03:24.320 --> 03:26.320
That's not what I meant.

03:27.400 --> 03:28.960
Is it good?

04:10.920 --> 04:12.120
I got the tally.

04:12.280 --> 04:13.520
but we haven't found the antidote.

04:13.840 --> 04:15.880
Find it while you have time.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.760
Did you kiss him?

04:18.600 --> 04:19.800
I asked you to lure him

04:19.800 --> 04:21.440
to put the medicine in the wine

04:21.440 --> 04:22.400
and lure him to drink it.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.280
I didn't ask you to kiss him.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.720
What does it have to do with you?

04:26.720 --> 04:27.640
You...

04:28.560 --> 04:30.280
General, Lieutenant General Wu wants to see you.

04:30.440 --> 04:31.240
General.

04:31.800 --> 04:32.480
General.

04:33.440 --> 04:34.240
General!

04:38.080 --> 04:39.400
Oh no, there's an assassin!

04:39.720 --> 04:40.680
Call the military doctor.

04:40.800 --> 04:41.840
Others search.

04:43.200 --> 04:43.760
This way.

04:43.760 --> 04:44.560
General.

04:45.440 --> 04:46.240
General!

04:46.800 --> 04:47.600
General.

04:53.480 --> 04:54.600
Search carefully.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.600
Is there anyone over there?

05:05.400 --> 05:06.280
Let's go over there.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.120
Hurry.

05:10.480 --> 05:11.520
Search carefully.

05:13.560 --> 05:15.320
If you don't use invisibility,

05:16.520 --> 05:18.280
we'll be caught red-handed.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.120
General.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.200
General.

05:39.440 --> 05:40.800
The Empress Dowager is missing.

05:41.200 --> 05:41.880
What?

05:42.240 --> 05:43.200
Go after him!

05:43.640 --> 05:44.480
Go after them!

05:52.440 --> 05:54.120
They've left, right?

05:55.280 --> 05:56.880
I can take you out of here.

05:56.960 --> 05:59.280
Why were you hiding here?

06:43.680 --> 06:45.040
General, no one is here.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.600
General.

06:46.600 --> 06:47.520
No.

06:48.560 --> 06:49.040
General.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.000
Not here either.

06:50.159 --> 06:52.920
The Demon Queen must have planned this.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.040
Oh no.

06:56.760 --> 07:00.400
I must have sneaked into the Camp.

07:00.960 --> 07:01.800
Pass my order.

07:02.200 --> 07:03.240
Forbid the city.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.440
You can only enter or leave.

07:04.760 --> 07:05.760
Yes.

07:27.200 --> 07:28.600
You're right.

07:28.600 --> 07:29.720
After the new emperor ascended the throne,

07:29.720 --> 07:32.360
he killed all the palace maids and eunuchs

07:32.360 --> 07:34.240
who served the late emperor.

07:34.240 --> 07:36.080
I saved a little eunuch

07:36.080 --> 07:38.520
and learned that the death of the late emperor wasn't an accident.

07:38.520 --> 07:39.320
It was the new emperor.

07:41.040 --> 07:42.600
Ji Hong Zhen

07:42.600 --> 07:44.640
is just an arrogant fool.

07:45.000 --> 07:46.680
Those royal relatives

07:46.680 --> 07:47.720
and aristocrats.

07:48.280 --> 07:50.440
can never submit to him.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.120
Let the people in the capital move.

07:54.640 --> 07:57.159
and spread the news about me in Baili Jinghong.

07:57.920 --> 07:59.000
Tell them

07:59.320 --> 08:03.120
General Baili ignored the royal power and kidnapped Empress Dowager.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.120
He must be disloyal.

08:14.520 --> 08:16.200
No matter

08:16.920 --> 08:18.600
or not,

08:19.520 --> 08:20.800
I will force him to rebel.

08:21.280 --> 08:23.120
He made it. I got the royal power.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.000
He failed.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.240
I have military power.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.720
When the crickets fight, the fisherman wins.

08:29.400 --> 08:30.800
I have to

08:31.760 --> 08:33.120
I have to take one.

09:12.200 --> 09:14.160
I didn't see you drink too much before.

09:15.160 --> 09:15.960
It's cold.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.320
It's just warm up.

09:32.760 --> 09:34.200
Your Highness drank too fast.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.240
It's bad for your health.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.680
It's cold and warm up.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.840
You chose a good yard.

10:37.840 --> 10:38.840
Young Master.

10:41.040 --> 10:42.120
Where am I?

10:42.120 --> 10:44.000
The residence that Empress Dowager asked Huo Ling Yu to find.

10:44.240 --> 10:45.560
General Shen was also rescued.

10:45.560 --> 10:46.960
and placed here.

10:49.040 --> 10:50.840
It's such a meticulous arrangement.

10:50.840 --> 10:51.840
I think

10:52.240 --> 10:54.480
her men in the Camp must have followed us.

10:55.680 --> 10:56.680
The tally is lost.

10:57.040 --> 10:58.840
General is looking for you.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.600
Bai...

11:00.120 --> 11:01.080
Are you picking a fight?

11:10.160 --> 11:11.400
You're awake.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.600
What’s your plan?

11:14.320 --> 11:15.720
I'll go back and find the antidote.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.880
It looks safe here.

11:18.400 --> 11:19.640
Wait for me here.

11:20.480 --> 11:22.000
Whether I can find it or not,

11:22.320 --> 11:23.640
I will come here

11:23.640 --> 11:24.880
to meet you.

11:37.560 --> 11:38.840
It's getting cold.

11:38.840 --> 11:40.320
This is a warm jade from volcano.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.360
It's good for your health.

11:53.480 --> 11:54.280
Three days.

11:55.520 --> 11:56.720
I'll give you three days at most.

11:57.400 --> 11:58.200
Okay.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.200
Shen Mingyue, let me tell you.

12:18.400 --> 12:19.480
In this world,

12:20.000 --> 12:21.520
no one loves you more than I do.

12:21.840 --> 12:22.640
What I said just now

12:22.880 --> 12:23.680
are sincere.

12:24.640 --> 12:25.560
Mother, you're wrong.

12:25.560 --> 12:26.520
She's not a loser.

12:27.400 --> 12:28.720
She is the light in my heart.

12:29.880 --> 12:31.160
glib-tongued.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.360
I don't know

12:33.360 --> 12:35.240
if it’s true.

12:48.200 --> 12:51.000
I’ve been in the north for years.

12:52.040 --> 12:53.680
If I want to control the North,

12:53.920 --> 12:55.640
the commander's seal is not enough.

12:57.280 --> 12:58.360
If I kill him,

12:58.960 --> 13:01.960
I don't have a powerful general to be used by me.

13:02.280 --> 13:04.480
The North will cause chaos.

13:05.680 --> 13:06.680
He Lian Jin.

13:07.560 --> 13:09.360
Will you let me down?

13:41.240 --> 13:44.320
Aoyi's medicine doesn't work anymore.

13:45.520 --> 13:47.840
I don't know how long I can live.

13:50.640 --> 13:52.400
General, I'm incompetent.

13:52.400 --> 13:53.480
I couldn't find the Empress Dowager.

13:54.200 --> 13:57.760
Shen Lian and Huo escaped.

14:10.840 --> 14:11.760
Tell me.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.600
Where did they go?

14:15.440 --> 14:16.280
I...

14:17.280 --> 14:18.600
I don't know.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.400
They all left.

14:24.640 --> 14:26.200
and left you alone.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.560
Are you still going to hide it for them?

14:30.920 --> 14:32.200
Her Highness only said

14:32.680 --> 14:35.800
send someone to send me out to reunite with my family.

14:37.040 --> 14:39.120
I really don't know anything else.

14:43.920 --> 14:45.240
If you don't know,

14:46.000 --> 14:47.520
it's useless to keep it.

14:47.520 --> 14:48.880
Kill him.

14:48.880 --> 14:49.920
General.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.480
Please spare her life.

14:53.200 --> 14:55.320
I'm willing to take 100 batons

14:55.320 --> 14:56.480
for her life.

15:00.080 --> 15:03.040
General, she is just a maid.

15:03.240 --> 15:05.880
I won't tell her the details of the Empress Dowager's escape.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.280
Please show mercy.

15:09.400 --> 15:10.120
Come on.

15:10.640 --> 15:12.320
You're useless.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.040
Thank you, General.

15:45.240 --> 15:47.280
You're mine now.

15:48.520 --> 15:52.000
General, I won't hurt you again.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.520
Don't be afraid.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.680
Why did you save me?

15:59.720 --> 16:00.960
I like you.

16:02.040 --> 16:02.840
I...

16:04.040 --> 16:05.440
I won't like you.

17:07.280 --> 17:07.760
Jiaga.
